===Etymology===
{{PIE root|ang|swep}}
From {{inh|ang|gem-pro|*swefnaz}}, from {{inh|ang|ine-pro|*swepno-}}, an extension of {{m|ine-pro||*swep-|t=sleep}}. Cognate with {{cog|osx|sweƀan}}, {{cog|non|svefn}} ({{cog|is|svefn}}, {{cog|no|svevn}}, {{cog|sv|sömn}}); the [[Proto-Indo-European]] root also led to {{cog|grc|ὕπνος}}, {{cog|la|somnus}}, {{cog|sga|suan}}, {{cog|cu|сънъ}}, {{cog|ru|сон}}, {{cog|lv|sapnis}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|/ˈswefn̩/|[ˈswevn̩]|lang=ang}}

